# Migrations are generated at first boot from the image this stack runs
# (auth_user_service/scripts/docker_start.sh) and belong to the deployment,
# not to the repository: a tracked snapshot would stop that generation and
# pin an old schema onto a newer image (B30, G28).
shared_migrations/*/versions/*.py
